>
>Then that site admin is a doofus.  The site admin is responsible for the
>newsgroups his site carries.  If he is requested to add alt.cancel.bots, and
>does so having read the disclaimers, then fine-n-dandy, he's made that 
>decision.  If he adds new news groups willy-nilly, he's not doing his job 
