"All newsgroup postings" is too extreme a statement.  I'm sure there are
many groups that nobody has bothered to immortalize on CD-ROM.

However, there are many groups that HAVE been recorded this way.  For
instance, I have a Walnut Creek CD-ROM (QRZ Ham Radio) that contains all
