I just got an interesting piece of PVT EMAIL in which 
a soc.motss regular (nameless for the time being) informed
me that a thread of long ago in which I was toying with 
Donald Davis resulted in PVT EMAIL to his postmaster.
 
Going back a bit, to shortly after that thread was over, 
I got PVT EMAIL from another regular who interpreted the
same exchange between Donald Davis and moi as a rape 
scenario.
 
My own use of the description "rape scenario" wrt that 
old thread (in a new thread called "About Donald Davis") 
was merely an attempt to help people identify 
that thread from their murky memories with some specificity.
 
I shouldn't have used the phrase "rape scenario".  As far as 
*I* am concerned, that is most definitely not a rape sequence.
I was, however, somewhat convinced that that was how it read 
to others.
 
Anyway, this PVT EMAIL re: "About Donald Davis" informed me 
that Donald Davis' postmaster had been contacted at the time
with complaints about Davis' behaviour, including references
to my contribution. (The email did state that it did not 
pretend to speak for, defend, or represent, me.)
 
When pressed for details on what was said, and to whom it was said,
email correspondent #1 became testy and defensive. I have no choice
but to lay the issues out here.
 
 
 
 
I hope people have no problem with seeing again some 
of what was posted at that time, because I think that 
it may be necessary to lay out the evidence that the 
more outlandish, "rapey" things in that thread were my 
own doing, and not the spawn of Donald's keyboard or mind.
 
Perhaps the exchange as it played out was better suited 
for a MUD than soc.motss, but it happened here. 
 
The inventory of toys and positions in the little drama included
Lithium enemas, physical restraint during anal penetration, 
resistance, aggressive physicality during the act, Miss Lee 
Press-on Nails, and show tunes. 
 
About the only things in this list suggested from Mr. Davis' 
brain were my bending over, the Lithium enemas, and a 
*question* on whether I should be restrained. To the last
question, I gave an enthusiastic, affirmative response. I replied 
enthusiastically to all of it, in fact, even offering 
to use my car.  I went even further, insisting that 
I liked "it" rough and active, and needed it to quiet me down.
 
In any case, speaking as someone who has just had self-appointed
net.cops contact my higher-ups about my "foul mouth", I find that
using Donald's brief, public e-fling with me as the basis of a 
ComplainttoPostmaster(TM) hasn't much to stand on. 
 
*I* encouraged Davis in a wild fantasy scenario, and I pride 
myself on coming up with the sickest stuff in the thread.
 
From a third party perspective, the whole thing begins to 
smack of entrapment to making provocative pronuncements, 
then whining loudly when delivered.
 
I am CC'ng this to Postmaster@Don's site, because I don't believe
that a person finding that exchange such a threat could
have been very restrained (pardon the expression) and reasonable 
in hir reports of it to Donald's sysadmins.  
 
I wish to make it absolutely clear to whomever Davis has
to answer that for all his shit-flinging here, that that
particular exchange between the two of us was egged on and
fleshed out by me. 
 
 
 
Email correspondent #1 has just informed me that s/he got no
response to the concerns emailed to Don's postmaster. 
 
Good.
 
 
 
++Sylvia
